We sincerely thank all of the reviewers for taking the time to review our work and for their constructive comments. In response to the feedback, we have now updated the paper to: 
1. Incorporate additional related work and references to better distinguish our contribution;
2. Include pseudocode and write our final objective more explicitly to aid reproducibility;
3. Explain our benchmarking procedure more thoroughly to highlight the strength and representativeness of our baselines;
4. Include an additional recurrent network baseline for our application to learning representations of environments;

in addition to other minor improvements to clarify the description of our contribution. We believe that our improved work provides a valuable contribution to learning with partial observations.
